		당신 안의 음란한 부분에 의해 길러진다. <span class="lewd">당신의 마음은 즉시 그것을 받아들인다.</span> 당신은 고통을 갈망한다. <<He>>【이가】 만족스러운 미소를 지어 보인다.
		<<masochism 10>>
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('willpower') gte random(1, 1000)>>
		당신 안의 반역적인 부분에 의해 길러진다. <span class="lblue">당신은 의지로 그것을 쫓아낸다.</span> <<He>>【이가】 눈살을 찌푸린다.
	<<else>>
		부르지도 않았는데 말이다. <span class="pink">당신은 그것에 저항할 수 없다.</span> 당신은 고통을 갈망한다. <<He>>【이가】 만족스러운 미소를 지어 보인다.
		<<masochism 10>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>>
	<</if>>
	<<hypnotised 1>><<set $combat_hypnosis to "masochism">>
	<<combat-reset-tool _args[0]>>
	<<set $NPCList[_n][$_hand] to "hypnosis_end">>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-hand-hypnosis-scream">>
	<<set _tool to (_args[0] is "left" ? $NPCList[_n].lefttool : $NPCList[_n].righttool)>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[0] + "hand">>
	<<He>>【이가】 <<print window.KR.getToolKr(_tool)>>【을를】 손바닥으로 감싸 쥐고 손가락을 튕긴다.

	<span class="pink">당신은 의식 속에서 무언가가 변하는 것을 느낀다.</span>
	<<if ($hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 5 or $hypnosis_traits.devotion is 4 and random(1, 100) gte 50) and $NPCList[_n].fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">>
		그것이 무엇이든 간에, 다른 무언가에 의해 가려진다. <span class="forest-green">대신, 당신의 마음의 눈 속에서, 그윌란이 당신의 얼굴을 조심스럽게 감싸 쥐고 <<nnpc_his "Gwylan">> 얼굴 앞으로 가져온다. 미세하게 찌르는 듯한 가시의 감각이 당신의 정신을 집중하게 만든다.</span>
	<<elseif !$hypnosis_traits.scream>>
		<span class="pink">최면적 갈망</span> 특성을 얻었습니다.
		<<set $hypnosis_traits.scream to 1>>
	<<elseif $hypnosis_traits.scream lt 5>>
		당신의 최면적 갈망이 더욱 깊어졌습니다.
		<<set $hypnosis_traits.scream += 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<hypnotised 1>><<set $combat_hypnosis to "scream">>
	<<combat-reset-tool _args[0]>>
	<<set $NPCList[_n][$_hand] to "hypnosis_end">>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-hand-hypnosis-cover">>
	<<set _tool to (_args[0] is "left" ? $NPCList[_n].lefttool : $NPCList[_n].righttool)>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[0] + "hand">>
	<<He>>【이가】 <<print window.KR.getToolKr(_tool)>>【을를】 손바닥으로 감싸 쥐고 손가락을 튕긴다.

	<span class="pink">당신은 의식 속에서 무언가가 변하는 것을 느낀다.</span>
	<<if ($hypnosis_traits.devotion gte 5 or $hypnosis_traits.devotion is 4 and random(1, 100) gte 50) and $NPCList[_n].fullDescription isnot "Gwylan">>
		그것이 무엇이든 간에, 다른 무언가에 의해 가려진다. <span class="forest-green">대신, 당신의 마음의 눈 속에서, 그윌란이 당신의 얼굴을 조심스럽게 감싸 쥐고 <<nnpc_his "Gwylan">> 얼굴 앞으로 가져온다. 미세하게 찌르는 듯한 가시의 감각이 당신의 정신을 집중하게 만든다.</span>
	<<elseif !$hypnosis_traits.cover>>
		<span class="pink">최면적 과시</span> 특성을 얻었습니다.
		<<set $hypnosis_traits.cover to 1>>
	<<elseif $hypnosis_traits.cover lt 5>>
		당신의 최면적 과시가 더욱 깊어졌습니다.
		<<set $hypnosis_traits.cover += 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<hypnotised 1>><<set $combat_hypnosis to "cover">>
	<<combat-reset-tool _args[0]>>
	<<set $NPCList[_n][$_hand] to "hypnosis_end">>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-hand-on-mouth">>
	<<rng>>
	<<if $enemyanger lte 20 and $enemytrust gte 20>>
		<span class="teal">순종적인 당신의 태도에 안심한 <<he>>【이가】 당신의 입에서 손을 뗀다.</span>
		<<combat-reset-hand _args[0]>>
		<<set $mouthuse to 0>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>>【이가】 계속해서 당신의 입을 꽉 틀어막는다.
		<<violence 1 1 1 1 _n>><<bruise face>>
		<<bodypart_admire_chance forehead>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-hand-on-hair">>
	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng gte 101>>
		<span class="lblue"><<He>>【이가】 당신의 머리카락을 놓아준다.</span>
		<<combat-reset-hand _args[0]>>
	<<elseif $enemyanger gte 61>>
		당신의 머리카락을 꽉 쥔 채, <<he>>【이가】 당신의 머리를 확 잡아당긴다.
		<<violence 4 1 1 1 _n>><<set $speechhair to 1>>
		<<bodypart_admire_chance forehead>>
	<<elseif $enemyanger gte 21>>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신의 머리카락을 한 움큼 쥔 채로 쓰다듬는다.
		<<set $speechhair to 1>><<neutral 1 _n>>
		<<bodypart_admire_chance forehead>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="lblue"><<He>>【이가】 당신의 머리카락을 놓아준다.</span>
		<<combat-reset-hand _args[0]>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-outfit-down">>
	<<set $_layer to _args[0]>>
	<<set $_target to _args[1]>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[2]>>

	<<set $_upperslot to ($_layer is "" ? "upper" : $_layer + "_upper")>>
	<<set $_lowerslot to ($_layer is "" ? "lower" : $_layer + "_lower")>>
	<<set $_targetslot to ($_layer is "" ? $_target : $_layer + "_" + $_target)>>

	<<set $_clothing_upper to $worn[$_upperslot]>>
	<<set $_clothing_lower to $worn[$_lowerslot]>>


	<<combat-pull-clothing-state $_upperslot "down" $_hand $_lowerslot>>

	<<set _origin to $_clothing_upper.state_top>>
	<<set _dest to setup.clothingStateNextDown[_origin]>>
	<<set $_upperStateSame to setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_upper.state] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
	<<set $_lowerStateSame to setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_lower.state] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>

	/* if the top of the outfit is below the original base of the upper portion, pull the upper portion's base down as well */
	<<if $_upperStateSame or setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_upper.state_base] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
		<<set $_clothing_upper.state to _dest>>
	<</if>>

	/* if the top of the outfit is below the original base of the lower portion, pull the lower portion's base down as well */
	<<if $_lowerStateSame or setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_lower.state_base] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
		<<set $_clothing_lower.state to _dest>>
	<</if>>

	<<switch _origin>>
		<<case "chest">>
			<<if $_target is "upper">>
				<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name 상의 부분을 끌어내려,
			<<else>>
				<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_lower.name【을를】 잡아당기며 $_clothing_upper.name 역시 끌어내려,
			<</if>>
			<<if !_toplessExposed>>
				당신의 <<exposedupper>>【을를】 드러낸다.
				<<neutral 2 _n>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="lewd">당신의 <<breasts>>【을를】 드러낸다.</span>
				<<neutral 3 _n>><<set $speechbreasts to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "midriff">>
			<<if $_target is "upper">>
				<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 복부 아래로 끌어내린다.
				<<neutral 1 _n>>
			<<else>>
				<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_lower.name【을를】 잡아당기며, 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 복부 아래로 끌어내린다.
				<<neutral 1 _n>>
			<</if>>
			<<if playerBellyVisible()>><<set $speechpregnant to 1>><</if>>
		<<case "waist">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 허벅지까지 끌어내려,
			<<if !_bottomlessExposed>>
				당신의 <<exposedlower>>【을를】 드러낸다.
				<<neutral 2 _n>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="lewd">당신의 <<genitals>>【을를】 드러낸다.</span>
				<<neutral 5 _n>><<set $speechgenitals to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "thighs">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 무릎까지 끌어내린다.
			<<neutral 1 _n>>
		<<case "knees">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 발목까지 끌어내린다.
			<<neutral 1 _n>>
		<<case "ankles">>
			<span class="purple"><<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 다리 아래로 완전히 벗겨낸다.</span>
			<<neutral 5 _n>>
	<</switch>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-outfit-up">>
	<<set $_layer to _args[0]>>
	<<set $_target to _args[1]>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[2]>>

	<<set $_upperslot to ($_layer is "" ? "upper" : $_layer + "_upper")>>
	<<set $_lowerslot to ($_layer is "" ? "lower" : $_layer + "_lower")>>
	<<set $_targetslot to ($_layer is "" ? $_target : $_layer + "_" + $_target)>>


	<<if $position isnot "wall">>
		<<set $_clothing_upper to $worn[$_upperslot]>>
		<<set $_clothing_lower to $worn[$_lowerslot]>>

		<<set _origin to $_clothing_upper.state>>
		<<set _dest to setup.clothingStateNextUp[_origin]>>
		<<set $_upperStateSame to setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_upper.state_top] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
		<<set $_lowerStateSame to setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_lower.state] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
		/* <<set $_clothing_upper.state to _dest>> */

		<<combat-pull-clothing-state $_upperslot "up" $_hand>>

		/* if the base of the outfit is below the original top of the upper portion, pull the upper portion's top up as well */
		<<if $_upperStateSame or setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_upper.state_top_base] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
			<<set $_clothing_upper.state_top to _dest>>
		<</if>>

		/* if the base of the outfit is below the original base of the lower portion, pull the lower portion's base up as well */
		<<if $_lowerStateSame or setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing_lower.state_base] gte setup.clothingStateIndex[_origin]>>
			<<set $_clothing_lower.state to _dest>>
		<</if>>

		<<outfitChecksExposed>>

		<<switch _origin>>
			<<case "waist">>
				<<if $position is "wall" and $walltype isnot "front">>
					<<combat-tug-clothing "over_lower" $_hand>>
				<<else>>
					<<if $_target is "upper">>
						<<He>>【이가】 돌돌 말려 뭉친 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 복부 위로 끌어 올린다.
					<<else>>
						<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 복부 위로 걷어 올린다.
					<</if>>
					<<neutral 2 _n>>
					<<if playerBellyVisible()>><<set $speechpregnant to 1>><</if>>
				<</if>>
			<<case "midriff">>
				<<if $_target is "upper">>
					<<He>>【이가】 돌돌 말려 뭉친 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 당신의 <<exposedupper>> 위로 끌어 올린다.
				<<else>>
					<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 걷어 올려,
					<<if !_toplessExposed>>
						당신의 <<exposedupper>>【을를】 노출시킨다.
						<<neutral 2 _n>>
					<<else>>
						<span class="lewd">당신의 <<breasts>>【을를】 노출시킨다.</span>
						<<neutral 3 _n>><<set $speechbreasts to 1>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<<case "chest">>
				<<if $_target is "upper">>
					<span class="purple"><<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 몸에서 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 벗겨낸다.</span>
				<<else>>
					<span class="purple"><<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing_upper.name【을를】 완전히 벗겨낸다.</span>
				<</if>>
				<<neutral 3 _n>>
		<</switch>>

	<<elseif $walltype isnot "front">>
		<<combat-tug-clothing $_targetslot $_hand>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-clothing-down">>
	<<set $_slot to _args[0]>>
	<<set $_clothing to $worn[$_slot]>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[1]>>

	<<set _origin to $_clothing.state>>


	<<combat-pull-clothing-state $_slot "down" $_hand>>

	<<switch _origin>>
		<<case "chest">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 끌어내려,
			<<if !_toplessExposed>>
				당신의 <<exposedupper>>【을를】 드러낸다.
				<<neutral 2 _n>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="lewd">당신의 <<breasts>>【을를】 드러낸다.</span>
				<<neutral 3 _n>><<set $speechbreasts to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "midriff">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 복부 아래로 끌어내린다.
			<<neutral 1 _n>>
			<<if playerBellyVisible()>><<set $speechpregnant to 1>><</if>>
		<<case "waist">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 허벅지까지 끌어내려,
			<<if !_bottomlessExposed and $_slot isnot "under_lower" and setup.clothes.lower[clothesIndex('lower', $worn.lower)].skirt isnot 1>>
				당신의 <<exposedlower>>【을를】 드러낸다.
				<<neutral 2 _n>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="lewd">당신의 <<genitals>>【을를】 드러낸다.</span>
				<<neutral 5 _n>><<set $speechgenitals to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "thighs">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 무릎까지 끌어내린다.
			<<neutral 1 _n>>
		<<case "knees">>
			<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 발목까지 끌어내린다.
			<<neutral 1 _n>>
		<<case "ankles">>
			<span class="purple"><<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 다리에서 $_clothing.name【을를】 완전히 벗겨낸다.</span>
			<<neutral 3 _n>>
	<</switch>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-clothing-up">>
	<<set $_slot to _args[0]>>
	<<set $_clothing to $worn[$_slot]>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[1]>>


	<<if $position isnot "wall">>
		<<combat-pull-clothing-state $_slot "up" $_hand>>
		<<switch _dest>>
			<<case "midriff">>
				<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 걷어 올려, 당신의 복부를 노출시킨다.
				<<neutral 1 _n>>
				<<if playerBellyVisible()>><<set $speechpregnant to 1>><</if>>
			<<case "chest">>
				<<if _toplessExposed>>
					<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 걷어 올려, <span class="lewd">당신의 <<breasts>>【을를】 노출시킨다.</span>
					<<neutral 2 _n>><<set $speechbreasts to 1>>
				<<else>>
					<<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 가슴 위로 걷어 올려, 당신의 <<exposedupper>>【을를】 노출시킨다.
					<<neutral 1 _n>>
				<</if>>
			<<case 0>>
				<span class="purple"><<He>>【이가】 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>으로 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 완전히 벗겨낸다.</span>
				<<neutral 3 _n>>
		<</switch>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $walltype isnot "front" and $_slot.includes("upper")>>
			<<combat-tug-clothing $_slot $_hand>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-clothing-to-side">>
	<<set $_clothing to $worn[_args[0]]>>
	<<set $_hand to _args[1]>>

	<<if playerHasStrapon() and $penisstate isnot 0>>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신의 <<print setup.colourName($worn.under_lower.colour)>> $worn.under_lower.name에서 <<print ($_hand is "left" ? "왼손" : "오른손")>>【을를】 치운다.
		<<combat-reset-hand $_hand>><<neutral 5 _n>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신의 $_clothing.name【을를】 옆으로 젖혀, <span class="lewd">당신의 <<genitals>>【을를】 드러낸다.</span>
		<<set $_clothing.state to "totheside">>
		<<combat-reset-hand $_hand>><<neutral 5 _n>>
		<<set $_clothing.vagina_exposed to 1>><<set $_clothing.anus_exposed to 1>><<set $_clothing.exposed to 1>><<set $speechgenitals to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-pull-clothing-state">>
	<<set $_slot to _args[0]>>
	<<set $_clothing to $worn[$_slot]>>
	<<set $_up to _args[1] is "up">>
	<<set $_hand to _args[2]>>
	<<if _args[3]>>
		<<set $_otherOutfitSlot to _args[3]>>
		<<set $_otherClothing to $worn[$_otherOutfitSlot]>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $_up>>
		<!-- pulling clothing up -->
		<<set _origin to $_clothing.state>>
		<<set _dest to setup.clothingStateNextUp[$_clothing.state]>>
		<<set $_clothing.state to _dest>>

		<<if $_clothing.state_top and setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing.state] gt setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing.state_top]>>
			<<set $_clothing.state_top to _dest>>
		<</if>>

		<<if $_otherClothing and setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing.state] gt setup.clothingStateIndex[$_otherClothing.state]>>
			<<set $_otherClothing.state to _dest>>
		<</if>>

		<<switch _origin>>
			<<case "midriff">>
				<<set $_clothing.exposed to 2>> <!-- breasts/chest now exposed below clothing bottom -->
			<<case "waist">>
				<<set $_clothing.exposed to 2>> <!-- genitals now exposed below clothing bottom -->
				<<set $_clothing.vagina_exposed to 1>><<set $_clothing.anus_exposed to 1>>
		<</switch>>

	<<else>>
		<!-- pulling clothing down -->
		<<if $_clothing.state_top>>
			<!-- upper clothing has a .state_top variable, and lower doesn't. -->
			<<set _origin to $_clothing.state_top>>
			<<set _dest to setup.clothingStateNextDown[_origin]>>

			<!-- pulling down open tops is only intended to free the tits, do not attempt to remove your bras by pulling them all the way down through the legs, baka! -->
			<<set $_min_dest to setup.clothingStateNextDown["chest"]>>
			<<set $_min_idx to setup.clothingStateIndex[$_min_dest]>>

			<<if setup.clothingStateIndex[_dest] lt $_min_idx>>
				<!-- this shouldn't happen, reset everything and quit -->
				<<set $_clothing.state_top to $_min_dest>>
				<<set $_clothing.state to $_min_dest>>
				<<set _origin to "none">>
				<<set $noupper to 1>>
				<<combat-reset-hand $_hand>>
				<<exit>>
			<<elseif setup.clothingStateIndex[_dest] is $_min_idx>>
				<!-- take npc hands off before continuing -->
				<<set $noupper to 1>>
				<<combat-reset-hand $_hand>>
			<</if>>

			<<set $_clothing.state_top to _dest>>

			<<if setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing.state_top] lt setup.clothingStateIndex[$_clothing.state]>>
				<!-- if the top of the clothing is as low as or lower than the bottom -->
				<<set $_clothing.state to _dest>>
			<</if>>

			<!-- adjust exposure -->
			<<if _origin is "chest">>
				<<set $_clothing.exposed to 2>> <!-- breasts/chest now exposed above clothing top -->
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _origin to $_clothing.state>>
			<<set _dest to setup.clothingStateNextDown[$_clothing.state]>>
			<<set $_clothing.state to _dest>>

			<!-- adjust exposure -->
			<<if _origin is "waist">>
				<<set $_clothing.exposed to 2>> <!-- breasts/chest now exposed above clothing top -->
				<<set $_clothing.vagina_exposed to 1>><<set $_clothing.anus_exposed to 1>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<if _dest is 0>>
		<<combat-reset-hand $_hand>><<clothesstripstat>><<generalStrip $_slot>>
	<</if>>

	<<outfitChecksExposed>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "combat-lift-skirt">>
